Description: Monitors the calls of an R package at run time. It uses the
    set-theoretic types that 'tyr' infers for the functions of the package.
    At the exit of each call, contractr sends queries to the 'rstt' type
    engine. The queries examine if
    the call is in the domain of the function and if the result agrees with its
    type. For a violation, contractr gives a warning or an error, as the
    severity specifies.
